
# Telemetry Dashboard Screenshots

This folder contains screenshots of the CanSat Ground Control Dashboard developed in LabVIEW NXG. These images demonstrate the user interface, telemetry logging, and block diagram used for real-time mission monitoring.

## Contents

### 1. Dashboard View
Shows the main Ground Control Station interface displaying:
- Live sensor graphs
- Mission status
- Battery percentage
- GPS coordinates
- IMU data
- Camera status
- Mission control panel

![Dashboard](Dashboard%20View.png)

---

### 2. Telemetry CSV Log
Displays the CSV file generated during the mission. All incoming telemetry packets are automatically logged for post-flight analysis.

Logged parameters include:
- Temperature
- Pressure
- Humidity
- GPS Coordinates
- Altitude
- Battery Percentage
- IMU Data
- Camera Status
- Mission Status

![Telemetry CSV](csv.png)

---

### 3. LabVIEW NXG Block Diagram
Shows the internal implementation of the Ground Control Dashboard, including serial communication, telemetry parsing, real-time visualization, and CSV data logging.

![Block Diagram](Panel%20View.png)
